<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MIXED AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MIXED AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates were</p>
<p>mixed at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Friday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate rose one basis point to 3.08 percent.</p>
<p>			   April 11 fix	   April 10 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	   3.05 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	   3.04 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	   3.08 pct		3.07 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	   3.21 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	   3.33 pct		3.33 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	  3.47 pct		3.47 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
